              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mutiviliri vandu vinyumba ya Levi avamenyaa mu madaala ginyu mba. Sivaveeye nikidieli anoho nimiandu jaavo aveene mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulimaliriza, vuli muhiga gwa kavaga mulaleeta izaka yi viamo muvivungizi mu madaala ginyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chukulia yiki keveeye cha vandu vinyumba ya Levi vosi, kigira sivaveeye ni kidieli anoho miandu jaavo aveene mba, kandi cha avageni, avavisandu, kandi avakunzakali avamenyi mu madaala ginyu. Kuduuka vaze vavuguli choosi cha venya. Mukore ndio, na Yahova Nyasaye winyu aduuki kumugaasiza mu viosi via mukora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.29"
            ]
          }
        }
